                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            "description": "API users can get real time live status data on demand for a given system. User can retrieve real time power for PV Production, Grid Import/Export, Consumption, Battery Charge/Discharge, and Generator. Users can also retrieve Grid Status, Battery Mode, and Battery State of Charge. User will receive the stream for a duration of 30 seconds by default and can configure the time in seconds by passing \u2018duration\u2019 as a parameter with a minimum value of 30 and maximum value of 300"
                          },
